WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Examination Room</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Examination Room</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Examination Room</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Examination Room</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
<b>Examination Room</b>

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.850
Trainer, you're overreacting!

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.300
I feel totally fine.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.780
Better safe than sorry.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.320
It doesn't hurt to have him take a look.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.670
I hope this doesn't take long! I wanna 
start my training for the Kikkashou.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.070
Tokai Teio-san?

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:17.790
What's up?

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:18.920
Your leg is broken.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.080
It's a fracture.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.580
You won't be racing again 
until spring of next year.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:27.480
I want you to check into the hospital.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:30.320
<b>Please be quiet
in the hospital</b>

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.870
Th-The hospital?!

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:35.700
No way! No way, no way, no way, no way!

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.950
You're sure it's broken?

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.230
It is.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.300
For now, I'm going to give 
her something for the pain.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:01:02.700
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.700
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:10.520
What did you just say?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.900
I said, I'm running in the Kikkashou!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.490
Running? But you're...

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:21.910
<b>Fire
Extinguisher</b>

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:18.420
Episode 2
Never Gonna Give It Up!

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:15.860
It's gonna take six months to heal,

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.480
and I'm not running
until next spring?

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:18.880
What do I care?

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.310
You seriously think that's gonna 
get me to give up on the Kikkashou?

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:23.720
You aren't, are you?

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.160
I'm gonna enter! And I'm gonna win!

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.420
All right, then... guess I better
 come up with a plan.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.610
I'm counting on you! I have to do this to 
become an undefeated Triple Crown winner.

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:37.630
I know, I know...

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.690
But the first step is to cooperate, 
and get admitted to the hospital.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.850
But I hate hospitals...

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.850
<b>TOKAI TEIO DIAGNOSED WITH FRACTURED LEG</b>

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.850
<b>WITH SIX-MONTH RECOVERY EXPECTED,
 IS HER ENTRY IN THE KIKKASHOU IN DANGER?</b>

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:47.850
She's in the hospital?!

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.350
No way! But she was in perfect shape 
during the race and the concert!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.610
<b>Tokai Teio's Leg Fracture</b>

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:01.060
Tokai Teio would've totally won the Kikkashou
if she was able to run in it.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.140
But there's no way she makes it in time now.

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.290
That's the thing!

