00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:58.920
<b>Goal</b>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.760
It's gotta have milk!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.190
You need that calcium.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.610
Oranges! For Vitamin C!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.210
Honey is a necessity as well!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:25.000
Carrots! It needs carrots! Even if it 
has nothing else, it needs carrots!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.150
Sounds good to me!

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:28.810
And then we'll throw in some 
garlic for stamina boosting.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:29.570
Teio!

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.650
What're you doing?

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:35.790
We were coming up with 
a special drink for you!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.310
Honestly, and with my 
Tennoushou race coming up.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.660
Do some taste-testing for us.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:41.890
No garlic, though.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:43.090
Why the hell not?

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.510
You guys are gonna listen 
to my opinion, right?

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.210
So, can I put the garlic in?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.230
Obviously not!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:54.020
