00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.960
<b>Practical Manual for
 Diagnosis During Rehab</b>

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.590
<b>Kikkashou Registration Form</b>

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.590
Spica

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.590
Tokai Teio

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.590
What else do we do?

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.930
Change her shoes?

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.470
But having her run in shoes 
she's not used to isn't realistic.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.210
There's a hot springs for 
horse girls in Iwaki.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:21.480
But doing something like that, 
so suddenly, carries a lot of risk.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:25.480
There are tights that work like 
support tape, but this is the G-1.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.110
There's just not enough time to incorporate 
it into her ensemble.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:31.360
Look at the mess you've made!

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.550
Teio? How'd it go at the hospital?

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.800
I've gotta keep my promise, huh?

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.410
We hang in there until the last minute.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:48.800
But if the doctor says it's a no-go, 
then I have to give up. Right?

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.730
As far as the Kikkashou goes—

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:52.350
Not yet!

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:57.640
We can't give up yet! 
There's gotta be something we can do.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:01.620
Teio, I swear, I'll help you become an 
undefeated Triple Crown winner!

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:02.610
It's okay.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.620
I mean it.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.500
Teio...

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.360
I still can't run at full strength.

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.640
So the idea of entering the Kikkashou,

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.850
and going up against everyone 
in their best condition...

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.880
I just couldn't do that.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.750
Thank you for everything, though.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.130
Come on, don't give me that look!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.140
I'm sorry.

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.860
Seriously, it's fine.

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.850
Hey, Trainer...

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.010
What's up?

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:39.010
<b>Kikkashou Registration Form</b>

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:39.010
Spica

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:39.010
Tokai Teio

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:36.750
Can you do me a favor?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:41.020
<b>Kikkashou</b>

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:41.020
<b>Kyoto Racecourse</b>

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:51.080
Thanks for bringing me.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:52.360
Sure.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:02.490
You want something to eat, Teio? My treat.

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:06.010
Then I'll have some grilled carrots, 
carrot juice, and a chocolate covered banana.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:08.250
Wow, could you show some restraint?

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:09.390
Please.

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.010
I'll just be a sec.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:21.710
You're not going to talk to her?

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.120
There's no need.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.180
I know Teio isn't the kind of horse girl 
to let something like this stop her.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:30.650
Are you sure it's not that 
you can't find the words?

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:31.910
That's harsh of you...

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.140
Sorry.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.600
But you're right.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:38.210
<i>Please...</i>

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:41.510
<i>Keep fighting your way forward, Teio.</i>

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.000
It's a beautiful day here 
at the Kyoto Racecourse,

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.870
but which horse girl will be going 
home with the the chrysanthemum medal?

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:50.180
It's a shame how things 
turned out for Tokai Teio.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:52.460
It would've been quite a sight, 
seeing her take the Triple Crown.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:55.370
A lot of attention is focused on Rionatal, 
who came in second place at the Derby,

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:57.930
and Nice Nature, who is 
currently on a four-win streak.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:58.960
I have to agree.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:02.760
They both look very calm. 
I think we can expect big things.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.040
All horse girls are now at the gate.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.610
And the Kikkashou...

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:30.040
<b>Kyoto</b>

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.430
...is off to a beautiful start!

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:34.440
They've all taken off, as the 
pack slowly starts to extend.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.550
In the lead is Nanto Mist, 
followed by Shinano Orange,

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:40.730
with K2 Suisan coming up on the inside, 
and Rionatal moving up from the outside.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.730
<i>It's started.</i>

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:42.830
The race has started out 
a slightly faster pace.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.560
Nice Nature in the back.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.060
<i>She's on a four-win streak, so I think we'll 
see something special today.</i>

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:50.210
<i>The crowd's cheers are washing 
over these horse girls.</i>

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.070
<i>You have to wonder if being 
able to keep their cool</i>

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:54.680
will be the determining factor 
in who comes out ahead.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:58.530
If it was me, I'd head to the middle.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.820
Then I'd check things out.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.420
The girl I raced against in the 
Derby would be next to me.

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.710
And Nature would be behind me, 
but I know she'd be coming for me.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.920
It looks like the places are holding 
steady as the race continues.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.670
Coming into the third corner, 
there'll be an ascent.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.670
Nanto Mist is still leading the way.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:20.360
<i>I'd hold back here and make 
my move on the next corner.</i>

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.470
It looks like Nice Nature and Rionatal, 
along with Breath Ooon Dance,

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.430
#8 in the red, are making their move!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:29.760
All 18 racers have bunched up again, and 
this race is turning out quite remarkably!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.190
Just look at them go!

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:32.760
It's anyone's game!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.900
<i>And this is where I would pick it up!</i>

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.620
<i>And get out in front!</i>

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:46.350
<i>And no one can catch up to me.</i>

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.710
Prez...

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:15.540
Rionatal is now in the lead!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.610
But Nice Nature is closing in!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.690
<i>I won't let them say it, 
I won't, I swear I won't!</i>

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.220
<i>I won't let anyone wonder about how this 
would've turned out if Teio was running!</i>

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.550
I'm not gonna lose to Teio!

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.540
We're better than her!

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:31.410
We're better!

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.430
I swear we're better!

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.240
Go...

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:47.120
Go! Run!

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.810
Rionatal! Rionatal!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.850
She crosses the goal in first place!

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:54.810
The Kikkashou was a tight contest, 
but she came out on top!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.110
I did it!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.860
Damn it!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.570
Fourth place! Good effort!

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:16.000
It's no fair, how they all looked so cool.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.360
Teio...

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:20.550
Sorry about the holdup. Here you go.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.360
Thanks!

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:25.380
Let's head home.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:30.450
Hey, Trainer... they were all amazing, huh?

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:32.020
Well, yeah.

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:35.470
They all went into the 
Kikkashou with a lot of drive.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:37.920
The ones who raced you in the Derby...

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.230
The ones who fought tooth 
and nail to enter...

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:41.920
The same goes for you, right?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:42.820
Me?

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:46.250
Wasn't all of that hard rehab so 
that you could win the Kikkashou

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:49.490
and become an undefeated Triple Crown winner?

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.350
I didn't make it in time, though..

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:55.380
Aw, come on, don't look so sad!

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.540
I've realized something, you know.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:07.400
I couldn't win the Triple Crown...
 but I haven't lost.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:09.390
Teio?

00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:13.340
So I can still be undefeated, can't I?

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:22.360
Yeah, you're right! You can 
be an undefeated horse girl!

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.780
Which means I'm gonna need 
to come up with a plan

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:26.590
for your training once 
you're back in action.

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:27.690
Sounds like fun!

00:22:27.690 --> 00:22:29.200
I'm counting on you, trainer!

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:31.200
Yeah, leave it to me!

00:22:31.810 --> 00:22:34.170
Please lower your voices while on the train.

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:35.310
Sorry.
